    "statement": "The reproduction steps of the verdict source were not repeated for this record. They ran on the sealed commit and the other roots bound by the seal, which this update leaves as they were. One of them recorded a clean run of the previous Proofs workflow on a GitHub Linux runner, which checked the Isabelle archive against the same pinned SHA-256; this update changes that workflow only in the address it downloads that archive from and by removing its weekly trigger. Of the steps that read records this update regenerates, the evidence verifiers, the release policy and the metadata checks of the saved-mode recomputations ran again on the updated tree, as listed under rebinding.newExecutions."
